There are three types of items that are very useful and IDed at a
glance.

Here's my correction for that.

Rose-tinted glasses: Causes hallucination when put on and cures it
when removed, but auto-curses.

Key of trapping:  Silently uses a charge and places a trap when
locking something, until it runs out of charges.  Always acts like an
ordinary key when unlocking, except that any traps it sets off are
more likely to be effective.

Apron of gender bending: When put on switches gender then vanishes.

All of these items would of course cost exactly the same as the usual
items, but at least they have a 90% chance of being generated cursed.

